<title>UK: BSkyB Q1 pretax profit soars 31 percent.</title>
<headline>BSkyB Q1 pretax profit soars 31 percent.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three months to Sept 30</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		3.9		    vs 3.0</p>
<p> Pretax		     66.26		  vs 50.77</p>
<p> Turnover		   266.03		 vs 214.50</p>
<p>NOTE - British satellite broadcaster BSkyB said its increased investment in all areas of programming and the quality and choice it offered subscribers would maintain its impetus.  </p>
<p> Operating profit	 79.47		  vs 66.20</p>
<p> Interest payable	 12.24		  vs 14.87</p>
<p> Tax			  nil		    vs nil</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 4017</p>
</text>
